    "Preserved exact additional readiness-helper source copy; SHA2f05b21f854d4e76f73c46eb5488f2797fa81f3df61747fe5713690e283907b8 matches executed helper and source manifest. Its ordinary git patch is empty because this is a newly untracked file; the full source copy supplies reproducible contents. Do not execute the archived copy in place; it is evidence only. Live confirmation's original70-source snapshot remains unchanged.",
